Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rifleheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a guy gotta do to\Nget a little food in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man's mechanical!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.82,0:00:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're von Stroheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is spookier than meeting a ghost\Nin a dark cemetery after midnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And von Stroheim,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.66,0:00:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who I could have sworn was blown\Ninto little tiny bits back in Mexico!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're both standing\Nright in front of me!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.31,0:00:46.77,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.31,0:00:46.77,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shijima-no-soko-kara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meta-menu-sono-hasira-tachi.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.40,0:00:50.61,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.40,0:00:50.61,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.61,0:00:53.99,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.61,0:00:53.99,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:00:53.99,0:01:01.24,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.99,0:01:01.24,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.00,0:01:07.79,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.00,0:01:07.79,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.00,0:01:07.79,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to call you a love song.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.79,0:01:16.51,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.79,0:01:16.51,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to call you a love song.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.51,0:01:22.60,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.51,0:01:22.60,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to call
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.39,0:01:29.23,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.39,0:01:29.23,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you a love song.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.23,0:01:33.07,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.23,0:01:33.07,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.07,0:01:38.49,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.07,0:01:38.49,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.33,0:01:41.58,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.33,0:01:41.58,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.58,0:01:43.83,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.58,0:01:43.83,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.58,0:01:43.83,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.58,0:01:43.83,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.83,0:01:47.67,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.83,0:01:47.67,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.67,0:01:53.46,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.67,0:01:53.46,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
