Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.47,0:02:07.60,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1170,865)}Episode 19: "A Race Toward the Brink" {Toni, Check that the title matches the preview at the end of 18 -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.40,0:02:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And von Stroheim is here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His hand looks like it's made of metal,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.04,0:02:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his face is wrapped\Nin some strange machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Germans must have been hiding this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What incredible medical technology!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.98,0:02:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be for some kind of military use?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.32,0:02:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's what saved your\Nmiserable life, von Stroheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.34,0:02:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,George, as you can see,\NI'm back from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I be happy about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.66,0:02:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get down to it,\Nhe's not exactly a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except for the fact that\Nhe's a damn German soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't like the way he struts around\Nlike he's better than everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I am a bit happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.34,0:02:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you make yourself at home on\Nthe sofa and watch me while I do my work?
