Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's glaring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows that I'm the one who\Nkilled ACDC, and he hates me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so... Kars!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm gonna just sit here\Nand let you try and psych me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.98,0:03:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, once I'm finished securing the\Nstone, I'm going to put an end to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad Wamu is still\Noff working in Greece.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't allow a Hamon user who was\Nable to beat ACDC to remain alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.34,0:03:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something, Kars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you speak as a warrior, or are you\Nafter something else, like revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fighting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Zavon who is going to\Nbe your final opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.30,0:03:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No machine can stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
