Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You utter fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,German science is the finest in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These arms have such great power,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they were constructed based on\Nthe abilities of San Viento!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unzocas!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've calculated exactly\Nwhat we need to do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to eliminate your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and leave you in desperate agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to pluck you like a chicken,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beat by beat, and take you apart\None square centimeter at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jojo, don't you dare even\Nthink about feeling sorry for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My proud new form is the\Nvery embodiment of the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.62,0:04:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ultimate peak of German\Nscience and engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.70,0:04:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm not merely human, I'm more.
