Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this, cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My machine gun can fire\N600 rounds per minute and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slid through armor plating\Nlike it was made of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll whittle you down into\Ntiny pieces in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:04:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body's mechanical, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It came from downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear the stone will be mine today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.10,0:05:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attempting to get it cost ACDC his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to allow his ultimate\Nsacrifice to have been in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That light, the blade coming\Nout of his arm is glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can control light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, brilliant bone blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That blade is hardened bone and skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be able to\Ndeflect bullets like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let alone slice them in half in mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His blade is amazing, but\Nwhy is it glowing like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.74,0:06:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, I, I know that sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upon seeing the blade up close, Von\NStroheim was able to understand its secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't have a simple edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rather, it had a rotating\Nblade moving at high speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny, razor-sharp claws slid quietly\Nalong the outer edge of the blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.72,0:06:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready to shred anything in its path.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each claw was flawlessly\Npolished to a mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-like finish and refracted\Nthe faintest light,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making the blade look as though\Nit were glowing from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least not with my weapons or any\Nmodern technology that I know of!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't defeat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what was San Bind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing but a weak child,\Na well-trained guard dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't even compare to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll take that stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ice-cold sheen across his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:07:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A blade that can cut bullets in midair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.22,0:07:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I could ever block\Nthat thing with only my bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I could concentrate all\Nof my harmon into a single blow,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.62,0:07:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that blade would still\Nslice right through me.
