Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be perfectly honest, I\Nwant to run away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's way too dangerous\Nto take on directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't think of any way to\Nget around that blade of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, I can't just leave\Nand let him take the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he obtains the stone's power,\Nhe'd become practically invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never be able to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get my hands on Womu's Antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars wants to kill me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was this in my horoscope?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is this what's in this pocket here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh the red stone of asia i have waited
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a long time for this 5 000 years and at\Nlast the stone is mine not that i ever
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:07:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doubted it would be it was destined to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fall into my hands cause just be patient
