Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Letting him walk away with the stone\Nwould mean the end for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think you've beaten me because\NI'm not finished with you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,German science is the world's greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.24,0:08:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Von Stroheim, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you sit there and\Nboast at a time like this?
