Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stone is sliding down the slope!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn it, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.26,0:08:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stone is sliding towards the cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it falls off, it could be lost forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.84,0:09:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what the hell look at this what\Nwhat happened in here cars happened
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.08,0:09:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo you have to go after the\Nstone grab it while you still can
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.58,0:09:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,damn he's catching up he's fast he's\Nfocused on the stone like a laser
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the way he keeps accelerating he must\Nbe planning to grab the stone and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fall off the cliff he won't be able\Nto stop before he reaches the edge
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,damn it the The drop beyond that cliff\Nis at least several hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all his superior abilities,\NKars could survive the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's as high as jumping off the\Ntallest skyscraper without a parachute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be certain death for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's passing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo plans to slow down before he reaches\Nthe edge so he doesn't go flying off,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but not Kars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm gonna let this\Nslime get his hands on the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:10:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, run hard, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, when I reach down to grab\Nthe stone, I'll be off balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With my flank open, I'll be vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that when you'll do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.66,0:10:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that when you'll try to kick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll attack me with your hamon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it means the stone\Ndisappears into the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think your plan will work, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.22,0:10:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look there! Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right on the nose, Kaz!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.66,0:10:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the kick you ordered! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, he's used his legs to pick up\Nthe stone right as Jojo kicked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.68,0:10:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Kars, what's with that\Nridiculously arrogant grin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm the one who\Nshould be smiling here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I should have\Nexpected as much from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.78,0:10:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A trick like that really\Nisn't good enough to fool me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My kick wasn't aimed at\Nyour vulnerable flank,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but rather the snow, and it\Nworked just like a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:10:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm the one who\Nmade the nice catch, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your trick, Kars!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A blade from his foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's falling viscars! What's happening?
