Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.64,0:11:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 175 meters to the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.24,0:11:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five seconds until impact! Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falling to my death with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swinging Hamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hamon goes through fluids easily, but ice\Nand snow are solid and impede the Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But water is trickling down the ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the Hamon can use that\Nto flow around the solids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, it's working perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:12:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you do,\Nthe stone will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That tenacity of yours, it's\Nwhat scares me the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.54,0:12:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm best at exploiting\Nmy opponent's negligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.24,0:12:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so a tenacious foe is the\Nabsolute worst for me to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.74,0:12:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tenacity is the opposite of negligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.28,0:12:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be mine today!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.58,0:12:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More icicles up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.98,0:12:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I can do anything\NI have to get this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.34,0:12:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blade out of my shoulder\Noh wait I can just send
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hamon through the blade\Nand directly into Cars
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take this as I thought I\Nknew you would try using my
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blade against me just\Nfor that it's into the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clip wall with you and\Nnow no wait he's gonna use
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that blade and cut me into\Npieces Cars is waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.78,0:12:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for Jojo to rebound before\Nhe starts cutting him
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can dodge that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to take great\Npleasure in slicing you in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.58,0:13:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,half and picking up the stone\Nat the bottom of the abyss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're not about to cut this, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't dare take the chance of\Nchopping the stone in half along with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can use your own strength\Nagainst you by letting
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.06,0:13:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your tenacity act as a\Ndefensive measure for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.64,0:13:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now eat this, Kars!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to use the\Nfallen icicles as a rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's clever, but they're\Nin a freefall, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.48,0:13:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll never reach the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, allow me\Nto lend a hand! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.76,0:13:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, nice timing, don't you think, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what are you two, some kind of a team?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fusing falling icicles\Ntogether to make a rescue rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:13:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had nothing to do with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.34,0:14:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only Jojo would try something\Nthat colossally stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.02,0:14:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least you were able\Nto think up a stupid
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trick and then pull it\Noff in the nick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real outstanding work, Caesarino. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.86,0:14:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And hey, if Lisa Lisa is up\Nthere, give her a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got the red stone and it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.74,0:14:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kept him from snatching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.74,0:14:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Caesar, you had\Nbetter pull him up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, my German compatriot,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your body is even more durable than\Nany of theirs could hope to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, if you can stop with the\Nsnobbery, maybe we can work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mafia!
