Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.22,0:15:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, you're a lucky one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you hold the stone for\Nme for at least another day.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.61,0:15:30.78,Title2.1,TS,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,805)\bord3\blur2}Five days until the remaining ring dissolves {Toni, should I put this under the Japanese? -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.61,0:15:30.78,Title2,TS,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,805)}Five days until the remaining ring dissolves {Toni, should I put this under the Japanese? -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.52,0:15:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is Switzerland's famous San Moritz,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.86,0:15:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a winter sports hub often\Nreferred to as Sun Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chic, relaxed, and sophisticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.74,0:15:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A resort that the wealthy\Nflock to during the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the cats look like\Nthey're owned by actresses
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.02,0:15:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and are pampered at all\Nthe finest spas in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't we fussy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even a tiny glance for shrimp?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.02,0:16:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little princess thinks\Nshe's the center of the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,universe but doesn't know a\Nthing about the world at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would this smoked salmon suit\Nyour snooty palate better?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems I've found what you prefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reach for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit higher now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stretch up just a little more there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotcha now.
