Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, did I upset you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy, you puny, pompous puffball.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.14,0:16:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was pretty mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I thought\Nit would be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just because I'm really on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only have five days\Nuntil the ring dissolves,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Cars is absolutely\Nserious about killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel the threats closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.78,0:17:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's always saying you\Ncan't sit around moping about stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, what are you doing\Njust sitting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up out of that chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come over here and look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.73,0:17:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be there in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.76,0:17:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The building on top of that hill is\Nthe address ACDC put on the package.
