Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the abandoned\Ncorpse of a shuttered hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.54,0:17:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would make a perfect hideout\Nfor Kars during daylight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every doorway and window is boarded up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sunlight could get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's got to be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.42,0:17:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Kars hides in\Nthere during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.06,0:17:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's just sitting inside\Nwaiting for Wangu to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.49,0:17:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what is the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.64,0:17:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a no-brainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.12,0:17:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars can't go outside as\Nlong as the sun is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that gives us a tremendous advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.82,0:18:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have to disagree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're looking at this wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's more dangerous\Nto attack when the sun is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars has been living like\Nthis for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have survived if he had\Nleft himself defenseless during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.76,0:18:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walking into his hideout and trying to\Ntake him down right now would be suicidal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.36,0:18:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be like a bug walking\Ninto a spider's web on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, this isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you scared or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to take\NSun Tzu's advice this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only engage in a fight\Nwhen victory is assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.62,0:18:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I'm not going in. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're chickening out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.16,0:18:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just thinking straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a cool head unlike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.48,0:18:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, we have to wait for\Nhim to make his move first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An assured victory is what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars is all alone there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.88,0:19:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him against all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a Fortun advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to strike now before Wamu\Narrives cutting that in half. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.24,0:19:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go off all crazy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.20,0:19:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try and keep your head together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.06,0:19:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just focus and think it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we go now, he'll cut us to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't approach this half-cocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not half-cocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.72,0:19:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am going to finally\Nfinish the fight That
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cut short the lives of\Nboth of our grandfathers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna destroy her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.78,0:19:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to finish it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.06,0:19:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why bring our dead\Ngrandfathers into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.80,0:19:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.26,0:19:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't drag the dead into\Nyour little drama, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Family you've never met and that came\Nlong before your time doesn't mean crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.94,0:19:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.16,0:19:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a complete idiot would\Ndie for something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.89,0:19:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You watch your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:19:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
