Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.46,0:20:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sucker punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.44,0:20:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell, Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.84,0:20:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.04,0:20:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.86,0:20:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, stop it! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, JoJo! Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard, what's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you completely lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're acting like some\Nkind of a madman Jojo,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.68,0:20:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you won't ever\Nunderstand the concept of
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,family honor and inheriting\Na battle like this Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, Jojo is right,\Nit's far too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.48,0:20:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no way of knowing what\Nmight be waiting for us in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll wait for Kars to make his move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is an order, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing that matters now is\Nprotecting the Red Stone of Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Coach. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't obey this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.86,0:20:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know this is a matter\Nof blood and family honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Zeppeli problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't leave it unsettled when\NI know exactly where Kars is hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.78,0:21:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't sit here twirling my thumbs,\Nwaiting for him to come to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.28,0:21:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.38,0:21:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow him and do whatever you\Nhave to to stop him from entering,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it means using force.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.70,0:21:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so damn grim and\Nhot-headed all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you be patient\Nand just wait a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, you've inadvertently touched\Non a painful piece of his hidden past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although you didn't mean to,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've hit upon a dark place where\Nhe harbors his saddest secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar has a hidden past
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell could it be?
